<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-6q-ss-2-logic-deontic-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Must pay overdue payment after recovery attempts";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(d) in addition to giving the notice, the provider has taken other steps to recover the amount of the overdue payment from the individual; and (e) the provider is not prevented by a statute of limitations from recovering the amount of the overdue payment.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The individual must pay the overdue payment after recovery attempts.";
