    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Permits credit providers to disclose credit eligibility information";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A disclosure by a credit provider of credit eligibility information about an individual is a permitted CP disclosure in relation to the individual if:";
