    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Requires";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Requires that the disclosure be made for the primary purpose of collecting payments";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(c) The information is disclosed to the person or body for the primary purpose of the person or body collecting payments that are overdue in relation to:";
