<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26wf-ss-1-logic-deontic-1> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition on action";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) an access to, or disclosure of, information is covered by paragraph 26WE(2)(a); and (b) the APP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file number recipient, as the case may be, takes action in relation to the access or disclosure; and (c) the APP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file number recipient, as the case may be, does so before the access or disclosure results in serious harm to any of the individuals to whom the information relates;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(e) an eligible data breach of the APP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file number recipient, as the case may be; or (f) an eligible data breach of any other entity.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
