    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits disclosure of personal information.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) personal information that relates to an individual is disclosed to the first person because of the operation of this Division; and  (b) the first person subsequently discloses the personal information.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Penalty: 60 penalty units or imprisonment for 1 year, or both.";
