    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "⊆";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Knowledge representation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The knowledge representation of a reference to collection, use or disclosure outside Australia is a subset of the knowledge representation of a reference to collection, use or disclosure within Australia.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Then it has the same effect as if it were confined within Australia.";
