    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of refusal to provide information or answer questions.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The person is required to give information, answer a question, or produce a document or record under this Act.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person contravenes subsection (1) if the person refuses or fails to do so.";
