    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of refusal to provide information or answer questions for corporations.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1AA) A person commits an offence if: the person is a corporation; and the person engages in conduct that constitutes a system of conduct or a pattern of behaviour; and the system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in 2 or more contraventions of subsection (1).";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person commits an offence if the person is a corporation and engages in conduct that constitutes a system of conduct or a pattern of behaviour.";
