    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Describes the temporal scope of journalistic material";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) Material is journalistic material if it:  (a) has the character of news, current affairs or a documentary; or  (b) consists of commentary or opinion on, or analysis of, news, current affairs or a documentary; or  (c) consists of editorial content relating to news, current affairs or a documentary.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "It is journalistic material until the specified conditions are met.";
